#: .\templates\about\about.html:11
msgid "About Speedy Composer"
msgstr "O Speedy Composer"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedycomposer.com/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Composer\">Speedy Composer</a> will be a new website for composing melodies "
"automatically for members of Speedy Net. It will use the technology of "
"Artificial Neural Networks to compose melodies for you. The melodies you "
"compose will be saved in your personal compositions directory. You will be "
"able to rename compositions, delete them and share them with your friends."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedycomposer.com/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Composer\">Speedy Composer</a> bo novo spletno mesto za samodejno "
"komponiranje melodij za člane Speedy Net. Za komponiranje melodij za vas bo "
"uporabljalo tehnologijo umetnih nevronskih mrež. Melodije, ki jih boste "
"skomponirali, bodo shranjene v vašem osebnem imeniku skladb. Skladbe boste "
"lahko preimenovali, izbrisali in jih delili s prijatelji."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:17
msgid ""
"Speedy Composer will be available in two languages - English and Hebrew. If "
"you want to know how it works, you can read the <a "
"href=\"https://www.speedysoftware.com/composer/\" title=\"Speedy Composer "
"(November 1999)\">documentation</a> from November 1999."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Composer bo na voljo v dveh jezikih – angleščini in hebrejščini. Če "
"želite izvedeti, kako deluje, lahko preberete <a "
"href=\"https://www.speedysoftware.com/composer/\" title=\"Speedy Composer "
"(November 1999)\">dokumentacijo</a> iz novembra 1999."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:19
msgid ""
"All the features on Speedy Composer will be free of charge. Speedy Net and "
"Speedy Composer are free software & open source projects. If you want to "
"help developing Speedy Composer, please contact me by email."
msgstr ""
"Vse funkcije Speedy Composer bodo brezplačne. Speedy Net in Speedy Composer "
"sta projekta proste in odprtokodne programske opreme. Če želite pomagati pri"
" razvoju Speedy Composer, me prosim kontaktirajte po e-pošti."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:21
msgid ""
"Speedy Composer is named after <a "
"href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the.female.dog\" "
"title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a>, a female dog that was with us for many years "
"and died in 2003. Speedy gave birth to 7 puppies in 1988."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Composer je poimenovan po <a "
"href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the.female.dog\" "
"title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a>, psički, ki je bila z nami več let in je umrla "
"leta 2003. Speedy je leta 1988 skotila 7 mladičev."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:23 .\templates\main\main_page.html:23
msgid "Thank you and good luck,"
msgstr "Hvala in veliko sreče,"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:24 .\templates\main\main_page.html:24
msgid "Uri Rodberg"
msgstr "Uri Rodberg"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:25 .\templates\main\main_page.html:25
msgid "Founder and Director of Speedy Net and Speedy Composer,"
msgstr "Ustanovitelj in direktor Speedy Net in Speedy Composer,"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:26 .\templates\main\main_page.html:26
msgid "Speedy Paz Technologies Ltd."
msgstr "Speedy Paz Technologies Ltd."

#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:9
msgid ""
"We are currently looking for volunteers to help us convert Speedy Composer "
"to Python."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno iščemo prostovoljce, ki bi nam pomagali pretvoriti Speedy Composer "
"v Python."

#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:15
msgid "Welcome to Speedy Composer!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli v Speedy Composer!"

#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:19
msgid ""
"Thank you for your interest in Speedy Composer. Speedy Composer is an "
"automated application for composing melodies for Speedy Net members. We "
"recently made changes to the source code of Speedy Net, and converted it "
"into the Python language and Django framework. Since Speedy Composer was "
"originally written in PHP, it is not adapted to work with Speedy Net in its "
"current form. So unfortunately we were forced to temporarily close the app "
"Speedy Composer. But don't worry, we kept backups of all the tunes composed "
"by Speedy Composer, and when the website is reopened we will upload them to "
"the new site."
msgstr ""
"Hvala za vaše zanimanje za Speedy Composer. Speedy Composer je samodejna "
"aplikacija za komponiranje melodij za člane Speedy Net. Pred kratkim smo "
"spremenili izvorno kodo Speedy Net in jo pretvorili v programski jezik "
"Python in ogrodje Django. Ker je bil Speedy Composer prvotno napisan v PHP, "
"v trenutni obliki ni prilagojen za delovanje s Speedy Net. Zato smo žal "
"morali aplikacijo Speedy Composer začasno zapreti. Ne skrbite pa, varnostne "
"kopije vseh melodij, ki jih je skomponiral Speedy Composer, smo ohranili in "
"ko bo spletno mesto ponovno odprto, jih bomo naložili na novo spletno mesto."

#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:21
msgid ""
"Speedy Composer and Speedy Net are open source applications, free software. "
"We are currently looking for volunteers to help us convert Speedy Composer "
"to Python. If you are interested in volunteering, please contact me by "
"email."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Composer in Speedy Net sta odprtokodni aplikaciji, prosta programska "
"oprema. Trenutno iščemo prostovoljce, ki bi nam pomagali pretvoriti Speedy "
"Composer v Python. Če vas zanima prostovoljno delo, me prosim kontaktirajte "
"po e-pošti."